SUMMARY:Heritage & Nature Walk
LOCATION:Coffee Kiosk (meeting point)\, Sunder Nursery\, Nizamuddin\, New
  Delhi 110013
URL:https://www.sundernursery.org/heritage-and-nature-walk.php
DESCRIPTION:A guided walk through Sunder Nursery's heritage monuments and
  gardens\, led by Sair-e-Nizamuddin. Meets at the Coffee Kiosk.\n\nSchedu
 led from Sunder Nursery's published standing timetable\, not from a dated
  listing — the venue does not publish one. Confirm before travelling: 9
 871066025 / 9911949854.\n\nhttps://www.sundernursery.org/heritage-and-nat
 ure-walk.php
CATEGORIES:walk\,heritage\,nature
END:VEVENT
